<mxCell id="a25" value="“Only use the article” is more tokens for the model to weigh — not a sandbox. A user who can break the template can impersonate a role. A longer instruction is better only when the extra tokens earn their cost on the eval." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="374" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
